WEBVTT

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.500
Beneath the roots and fallen leaves

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.700
Beyond the world our eyes can see

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.500
A silent web has always grown

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:40.780
A hidden life beneath our own

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.660
No voice, no words, no beating heart

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:50.660
Yet every thread becomes a part

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:55.820
Of something ancient, vast and deep

00:00:56.120 --> 00:01:01.900
Awake below while we still sleep

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:06.900
For centuries we walked above

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:13.520
Unaware of what connects us

00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:18.520
Listen to the forest

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:22.520
Listen to the ground

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:27.520
The oldest living network

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:32.520
Has always been around

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:38.100
A million unseen pathways

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:43.580
A language yet unknown

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:47.180
We are only learning

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:55.490
How to hear its tone

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:57.140
Through storm and fire, drought and rain

00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:59.660
The network learns, adapts, sustains

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:02.100
It feeds the weak, it shares the light

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.580
It keeps the balance out of sight

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:07.020
No king, no center, no command

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:09.620
Yet forests rise from thread and strand

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:12.020
A living map beneath our feet

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:15.340
Where countless lives and signals meet

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:18.630
Not to conquer

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:20.340
Not to own

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.410
But to understand

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:28.400
Listen to the forest

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:33.940
Listen to the ground

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:38.730
The oldest living network

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:43.010
Has always been around

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:49.060
A million unseen pathways

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:53.960
A language yet unknown

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:57.720
We are only learning

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:03.060
How to hear its tone

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:08.240
Science lights the pathway

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:13.230
Wonder starts the flame

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:17.940
Questions lead us forward

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:23.920
Before we know the name

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:27.920
Every signal matters

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:33.600
Every voice may grow

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:38.590
The future starts with listening

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:43.180
To what we do not know

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:46.510
Listen to the forest

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:54.220
Listen to the trees

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:58.330
Listen to the hidden world

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:02.190
Beneath the roots we see

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:07.490
A million unseen pathways

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:11.890
Connected all as one

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:16.990
And we have just begun

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:26.540
We have just begun

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.920
Beneath our feet

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:33.680
The network waits

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:38.770
And we have just begun

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.870
To listen

